			<h1>A vision and a prototype will only get you so far.<br/>
Highway1 helps you build a business.</h1>
<p>Our four month program supplies you with:</p>
<p>• A dedicated staff of experienced engineers ­<br/>
• An inside view into the supply chain and manufacturing infrastructure in China<br/>
­• An education in manufacturing, supply chain, and distribution as well as project and business management, finance, and strategy<br/>
­• Office &amp; machine shop space in San Francisco<br/>
­• Mentorship and guidance from across the tech sector<br/>
­• Fine-tune your pitch for potential investors­<br/>
• Access to an extensive network of investors<br/>
• Seed Funding of $50,000 in return for 4-7% equity</p>
<p>We&#8217;re looking for small teams that want to build hardware companies for the long term. If this describes you, let us know.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><br class="blank"/><a class="red_button" title="Apply on AngelList" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140625111501/https://angel.co/highway1">Apply on AngelList</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Product Development</h2>
<p>Work alongside our in­house engineers to finalize your prototype and design the finished product for manufacture at scale.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Sourcing and Fulfillment</h2>
<p>Gain detailed knowledge about production and fulfillment with sustainability in mind, from optimizing your supply chain infrastructure, to inventory management, and retail distribution</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Business 101</h2>
<p>Learn how to set up and manage your business right from developing your market strategy to managing cash flow and optimizing your team</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Equity Financing</h2>
<p>Highway1 provides you the cash for living expenses and prototyping, so you can concentrate on getting your business off the ground.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Office Space</h2>
<p>Share a bright, modern office space with like­-minded peers.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Machine Shop</h2>
<p>Access to a modern, fully-equipped machine shop and rapid prototyping facility with equipment valued at over $3M.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Travel to China</h2>
<p>Fly to Shenzhen with us to tour the facilities that will manufacture your product</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Corporate Perks</h2>
<p>Our partner sponsors can help you get started with some valuable credits.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><br class="blank"/><a class="red_button" title="Apply on AngelList" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140625111501/https://angel.co/highway1">Apply on AngelList</a></p>
